{"ticker":{"symbol":"131090.KQ","name":"시큐브","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":4225.0,"change_pct":-0.016298020954598424,"market_cap":31730683904.0,"pe":null,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":0.03550295857988166,"week52_low":0.0,"week52_high":5220.0,"sector":"Technology","industry":"Software - Infrastructure","country":"South Korea","city":"Seoul","employees":67,"website":"https://www.secuve.com","business_summary":"Secuve Co., Ltd. provides information security solutions primarily in South Korea. It offers iGRIFFIN, an integrated account authority management technology; LogGRIFFIN, a real-time tamper-proof log storage technology; DuoGRIFFIN, a domain separation-based information leak prevention technology; CERTl, a technology to prevent illegal copying and leakage of public certificates; T/Q in Z, a mobile authentication and technology; QuickSign, a payment technology; and SecuS ign, a biometric handwritten signature and authentication technology to the financial sector, corporations, financial institutions, and public and defense sectors. Secuve Co., Ltd. was founded in 2000 and is headquartered in Seoul, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"시큐브(주)는 주로 한국에서 정보 보안 솔루션을 제공합니다. 통합 계정 권한 관리 기술인 iGRIFFIN을 제공합니다. 실시간 변조 방지 로그 저장 기술인 LogGRIFFIN; 도메인 분리 기반 정보 유출 방지 기술인 DuoGRIFFIN; 공인인증서의 불법 복제 및 유출을 방지하는 기술인 CERTl; T/Q in Z, 모바일 인증 및 기술; 결제 기술인 QuickSign; 금융권, 기업, 금융기관, 공공 및 국방 분야에 생체인식 수기 서명 및 인증 기술을 제공하는 SecuS ign이 있습니다. 시큐브(주)는 2000년에 설립되었으며 대한민국 서울에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null},{"period":"2027","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"인프라 소프트웨어","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":13702794760.0,"operating_income":5304365420.0,"net_income":4825964000.0,"eps":590.0},{"period":"2023","revenue":14445671810.0,"operating_income":4453118960.0,"net_income":5786793030.0,"eps":715.0},{"period":"2024","revenue":12075656390.0,"operating